        example: "def compare_emh_forms():\n    emh_levels = [\n        (\"Weak-Form Efficiency\", \n         \"Current stock prices fully reflect all historical price and volume trading information. Technical analysis (moving averages, chart patterns) cannot consistently generate abnormal risk-adjusted returns (alpha).\"),\n        (\"Semi-Strong-Form Efficiency\", \n         \"Current stock prices fully and instantaneously adjust to all publicly available information (annual reports, earnings announcements, macro data). Fundamental analysis cannot consistently beat the market without unique insights.\"),\n        (\"Strong-Form Efficiency\", \n         \"Current stock prices reflect all information, both public AND private (insider information). Even corporate insiders cannot earn abnormal returns (empirically rejected due to profitable insider trading).\")\n    ]\n    \n    print(f\"{'EMH Form':<25} | {'Information Set Reflected & Practical Investment Implication'}\")\n    print(\"=\" * 115)\n    for name, desc in emh_levels:\n        print(f\"{name:<25} | {desc}\")\n\ncompare_emh_forms()\n",
